%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Levels_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a02e01ee9c8597e479b3ddb25f58e717, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 72150890864889856
    m_Localized: The Lighthouse Keepers' Union
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889857
    m_Localized: one bulb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889858
    m_Localized: The star is not a planet. It bends the same way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889860
    m_Localized: Strait & Narrow Ltd.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889861
    m_Localized: a wide load
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889862
    m_Localized: The Wrap takes as well as gives. A smaller world is a wider door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889863
    m_Localized: Shrink the rock, not the cargo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889864
    m_Localized: Madame Fink's Discount Gravity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889865
    m_Localized: a piano
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889866
    m_Localized: The Wrap is yours to place. Where you work is a decision. Make it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889867
    m_Localized: Now move it. Where is a choice. Works everywhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889868
    m_Localized: The Third Best Bakery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889869
    m_Localized: a wedding cake, still warm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889870
    m_Localized: The Wrap is yours to place. Use it more than once. Wrap only what you need; the universe is not insured.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889871
    m_Localized: Several zones. Place it, scale them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889872
    m_Localized: Nobody & Co.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889873
    m_Localized: a body (a funeral)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889874
    m_Localized: The field is free. The Wrap is not.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889875
    m_Localized: Use what is already there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889876
    m_Localized: The Inheritance of Mr. Fink
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889877
    m_Localized: the last of something
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889878
    m_Localized: This is the one the manual was written for. Welcome, new employee. There has not been a new employee in eleven years. There is still no office.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164255
    m_Localized: That is every contract we have.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164254
    m_Localized: '> MORE CONTRACTS IN THE MAKING

      > REPLAY A JOB FOR 3 STARS'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164253
    m_Localized: Efficiency is a virtue until it is a cost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164252
    m_Localized: The Very Small Opera
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164251
    m_Localized: the orchestra, one live animal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164250
    m_Localized: Three ships. The budget did not grow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164249
    m_Localized: The opera starts without them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164248
    m_Localized: Three for the price of one. I am not sure that is good news.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164247
    m_Localized: Many routes may share one end. Fix the approach once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164246
    m_Localized: The Last Two Customers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164245
    m_Localized: two halves of a gift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164244
    m_Localized: Two ships. One door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164243
    m_Localized: The gift is still in pieces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164242
    m_Localized: One door. Two deliveries. The ledger smiles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164241
    m_Localized: One origin. Two promises. Bend near the start and both feel it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164240
    m_Localized: Slightly Used Stars Ltd.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164239
    m_Localized: two refurbished suns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164238
    m_Localized: They are back. They want both orders today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164237
    m_Localized: Slightly Used Stars is unhappy again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164236
    m_Localized: They paid. They did not say thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164235
    m_Localized: Two ships. One Wrap. One budget.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164234
    m_Localized: Halfmoon & Halfmoon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164233
    m_Localized: two identical parcels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164232
    m_Localized: I sold two runs for the price of one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164231
    m_Localized: One of them got lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164230
    m_Localized: Both arrived. Same cost. Nobody asked how.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164229
    m_Localized: "\u2026Good luck."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164228
    m_Localized: Mr. Fink is still waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164227
    m_Localized: Today the space. Tomorrow the time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164226
    m_Localized: The console stays where it is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164225
    m_Localized: The ledger is happy. For now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164224
    m_Localized: Mr. Fink's estate says there's nothing else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969945
    m_Localized: The inheritance is delivered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969944
    m_Localized: The field won.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969943
    m_Localized: The field did the work. That is our margin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969942
    m_Localized: Nobody & Co. says the funeral can start on time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969941
    m_Localized: The body is delivered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969940
    m_Localized: The cake went cold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969939
    m_Localized: Nobody orders more cake. They just want it cheaper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969938
    m_Localized: The Third Best Bakery says it's the best they've done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969937
    m_Localized: The cake arrived still warm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969936
    m_Localized: The piano is lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969935
    m_Localized: The ledger is happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969934
    m_Localized: Madame Fink says it plays.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969933
    m_Localized: The piano is delivered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969932
    m_Localized: Too much rock in the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969931
    m_Localized: Cheaper than fuel. Much cheaper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969930
    m_Localized: Strait & Narrow measured it twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969929
    m_Localized: The wide load is through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969928
    m_Localized: The star is a source too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969927
    m_Localized: The bulb is still out there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969926
    m_Localized: No fuel burned. The ledger is happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969925
    m_Localized: The Keepers say it's the right colour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969924
    m_Localized: The bulb is delivered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969923
    m_Localized: Launch your next job from the map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969922
    m_Localized: You bend space. Ships get through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969921
    m_Localized: I'm Jim. This is Our Space Corp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969920
    m_Localized: Nice. The ship made it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164256
    m_Localized: The tech team says more are coming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164257
    m_Localized: Get some sleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889879
    m_Localized: The Wrap works. So I sold more of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889880
    m_Localized: Same entropy. More ships.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889881
    m_Localized: The brochure says green. It is just cheaper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889882
    m_Localized: Fuel is still capped. Nobody else can do this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889883
    m_Localized: They are back because nobody else is left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889884
    m_Localized: The last two customers. We keep them happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
